- curated_Peaceableness_curated_chunk_2 | Peaceableness (curated) | "+X to Max Peaceableness" while the drink buff lasts. No equipment item grants Max Peaceableness. - Why the indicator icons vanish after raising Max: the UI keys the high/low peaceable icons to the ratio of Current to Max Peaceableness (CurPeaceablenessRatio). Raising Max while Current stays fixed lowers the ratio away from both extremes, so neither icon shows — but the XP bonus/penalty still applies from the underlying Current value. The game does not display exact thresholds.
- Telka's Teeth drug grants "XP Earned while Peaceable +25%" (TelkasTeeth buff; its withdrawal applies "XP Penalty When Not Feeling Peaceable -50%").
- SHOW_PEACEABLENESS_INDICATORS controls whether the peaceableness mood indicator icons appear on the effect bar.
