- curated_Peaceableness_curated_chunk_0 | Peaceableness (curated) | Peaceableness (Rakshasa mood stat)

Peaceableness is a racial mood stat for the Rakshasa. Every race has one: Elves track Cleanliness, Humans track Community, Fae track Fae Energy, and Rakshasa track Peaceableness. The CUR_PEACEABLENESS attribute (Current Peaceableness) tracks it, defaulting to 50 of a MAX_PEACEABLENESS (Max Peaceableness) of 100.
